# Sharing in and out (ShareActivity.kt, ShareSheet.kt; DriveScreen.kt's 分享): a link shared in (another app's share
# sheet: here the app started with it, MBUI_SHARE_TEXT; on Android the check also hands one in by an intent) opens the
# sheet of chats (发到); the test chat tapped: the link a card in its composer (its site), sent as words (its title,
# then the link); then a file of the drive handed out to the system's share sheet.
#env MBUI_SHARE_TEXT=https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=e2e{T}
#env MBUI_SHARE_TITLE=列表视频{T}
timeout 60000
until 发到
until 列表视频{T}
until 新 chat
shot 1-sheet
tap 端到端测试
until youtube.com
shot 2-composer
tap icon:arrow-up
gone 正在发送
timeout 120000
until 列表视频{T}
shot 3-sent
back
timeout 60000
until 端到端测试
tap icon:folder
until =e2e-{T}
tap =e2e-{T}
until 说明.txt
hold 900 说明.txt
until 已选 1 项
tap icon:more
until 分享
# (the last step: on Android the system's share sheet then covers the app; the check looks at it)
tap 分享
linger 20000
